//RS 
//RS /// Replace the ambient list projection after a mutable view write-back. The
//RS /// adapter supplies only the already-marshalled values; storage exclusivity,
//RS /// mutation policy, and the resulting canonical row-major metadata remain in
//RS /// the shared Prelude.
